LAST WILL OF THE FOURTH HOKAGE — SEALED RECORD
Minato Namikaze, Yondaime Hokage

Recorded on the night of the Nine-Tails' attack. Access: Hokage seal.

"To the village I love: a masked man loosed the Nine-Tailed Fox upon
us this night. I have no choice but to seal it, and the only vessel I
can trust is my newborn son.

I ask the village to see Naruto Uzumaki not as the beast he carries,
but as its jailer — a hero who holds back its fury. Treat him as the
child of the Fourth Hokage, and give him the love and recognition he
will need.

I split the fox's chakra, sealing the Yin half within myself and the
Yang within Naruto with the Eight Trigrams Seal. Kushina and I give
our lives gladly for his future and the village's.

Naruto — become a splendid shinobi. We believe in you."

Executed by the Reaper Death Seal. See the Nine-Tails containment log.
